      "firstSeenTime": 1777456786038,
      "lastSeenTime": 1777456786038,
      "summary": "Keyboard users must be able to navigate to all the interactive elements on the page.",
      "description": "**Cause:** \nThe element is missing the right tags or has incorrect tags. \n**Effect:** \nThe element is excluded from the keyboard tab sequence and is therefore inaccessible to keyboard users. \n**Suggested Solutions:**\nUse one of these approaches: \n* Approach 1 (recommended): Add a tag that shows the element's purpose. Interactive elements don't need anything extra because they are focusable by nature. \n* Approach 2: Add a `tabindex` attribute with the value of `0` to the element.",
      "tags": [
        {
          "id": "WCAG-2.1.1",
          "description": "2.1.1 Keyboard  (Level A)",
          "link": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/Understanding/keyboard.html"
        },
        {
          "id": "WCAG-A"
        },
        {
          "id": "WCAG-undefined"
        },
        {
          "id": "WCAG2.0"
        }
      ],
      "knowledgeBaseLink": "https://knowledge.evinced.com/system-validations/keyboard-accessible",
      "isNeedsReview": false,
